WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:28.400
<v Calypso>Here at the island's edge the tall trees stand — alder and poplar and sky-high fir, long dry, that will ride light on the water. Take the great bronze axe and the adze; here is cloth for a sail and cord to lace her. Build, and I will bring all the rest.

2
00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:40.610
<v Narrator><i>Calypso fells, trims, bores, joins, decks, and fences the timbers over four days.</i>

3
00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:49.860
<v Narrator><i>Calypso rigs mast, yard, sail, steering oar, and ballast.</i>

4
00:00:49.910 --> 00:01:01.710
<v Narrator><i>Calypso bathes and clothes him, loads food and water, and sends a warm wind behind the raft.</i>
